JOINT COMMUNICATION TO THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT, THE EUROPEAN COUNCIL, THE COUNCIL, THE EUROPEAN ECONOMIC AND SOCIAL COMMITTEE AND THE COMMITTEE OF THE REGIONS on the European Preparedness Union Strategy

{{1 April 2025 - Communication on EU Security Union Strategy - ProtectEU (COM(2025) 148 final)}} 
It describes the Commission plans for strengthening Europe’s defence and security capabilities. It follows the White Paper on European Defence and the European Preparedness Union Strategy. It reiterates the intention of the Commission to assess the implementation and enforcement of the Critical Entities Resilience (CER) Directive and of the Directive on measures for a high common level of cybersecurity across the Union (NIS2). 

