{{{Leaflet 920-8}}}
The allocation is described in UIC leaflet 920-8 available at https://shop.uic.org. UIC members can download the leaflet using their company specific user ID and password. Non-members can order the leaflet.
{{{Number series}}}
According to the leaflet the numbers are divided as follows:
|{{From}}|{{To}}|{{Purpose}}| |0001.00|4999.99|For domestic tariffs or tariffs with only one RU involved| |5000.00|7999.99|For international tariffs with two RUs involved (bilateral tariffs)| |8000.00|8199.99|For the OSJD for multilateral tariffs| |8200.00|9999.99|For the UIC for multilateral tariffs|
{{{Code allocation}}}
Tariff numbers between 8200.00 and 9999.99 are assigned by the UIC. Requests should be addressed to {{tariffs@uic.org}} and include at least:
-* Date of introduction (or abolition) of a tariff, -* Railway undertakings involved
{{{Self managed series}}}
Railway undertakings may manage number series xxxx.00 to xxxx.99 for their specific multilateral tariffs.
Contact {{tariffs@uic.org}} for details.
{{{Bilateral Tariffs}}}
We do not allocate Tariffs numbers for tariffs between two RUs. It is up to each RU with the partner RU to guarantee the uniqueness of the tariff number.

